ound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"gameOutcomes":[{"titan":"herald","day":95,"outcome":"refused","detail":{"gate":"muster","have":0,"need":10}}],"end":null}],"fieldFights":[{"day":93,"vid":"visjoin_76","mid":"herald","wave":4,"outcome":"vFlee","rounds":2,"vTaken":23,"mDealt":21,"vHpLeft":68,"mHpLeft":504,"log":["Fang has Crossbow but no arrows — the string stays drawn, useless.","Fang's gear absorbs 24.","R1: First Omen hits Fang for 12 (79 left)","R1: Fang walks in open-handed — and it goes wrong. It doesn't want peace. They're exposed, off-balance. (Walk In — failed)","  still off-balance from the failed parley, Fang takes it worse. (Peacemaker — exposed)","Fang's gear absorbs 22.","R2: Second Omen hits Fang for 11 (68 left)","R2: Fang strikes for 21 (504 left)","Fang sees how this ends — and runs while running still works."]}],"kills":[],"musterEvents":[],"census":[{"day":2,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":2,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":4,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":4,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":5,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":6,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":7,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":8,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":9,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":10,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":11,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":12,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":13,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":14,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":15,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":16,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":17,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":18,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":19,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":20,"uw":1,"rank":"village"},{"day":21,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":22,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":23,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":24,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":25,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":26,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":27,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":28,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":29,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":30,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":31,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":32,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":33,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":34,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":35,"uw":2,"rank":"village"},{"day":36,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":37,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":38,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":39,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":40,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":41,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":42,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":43,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":44,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":45,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":46,"uw":3,"rank":"village"},{"day":47,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":48,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":49,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":50,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":51,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":52,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":53,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":54,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":55,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":56,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":57,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":58,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":59,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":60,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":61,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":78,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":79,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":80,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":81,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":82,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":90,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":91,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":92,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":93,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":94,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":95,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":95,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Cormac heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","Shulan is over the cookpot, blowing on a spoonful before it goes back in.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Shulan left 3 rawhides by the stash. No announcement. That's how it works here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Cormac telling Shulan about Angelo. Half of it's true anymore. You're not sure which half.","🚶 Sam is back with Fang.","Angelo heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","💧 Fang returns with water: +2 clean.","📖 Fang is going over their finds, re-tying the bundle.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Daughter's Drawing. Kitchen table, burnt pancakes. You told her the sun needed holding, and she took you literally — drew you carrying it with both hands. She was six. The sky changed three weeks later. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","One down — but 3 still hold the treeline. The gorge goes on.","One down — but 3 still hold the treeline. The gorge goes on.","Something moves out there — Big Ugly.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 22× Muscadine Grapes (1980 kcal). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","While you were gone — 3 things you missed:","⚔️ Fang stared down the Big Beast and it backed off — 0 rounds, not a scratch on them. It's still out there, somewhere.","⚔️ Fang stared down the Paparazzo and it backed off — 0 rounds, not a scratch on them. It's still out there, somewhere.","🩸 The Herald mauled Fang (-23 health) over 2 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing.","The pantry is bursting past tomorrow — most of the haul stays in your pack. The fire can wait; the road can't.","You keep a day's food (2550 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 50 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","Donated Muscadine Grapes (+90 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Blackberry: 180 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","Cormac left 1 branch by the stash. No announcement. That's how it works here.","🌱 Fang waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait.","🌿 Fang checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~10 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep.","🪵 Fang hauls back 9 wood. The pile grows. (504 logs now.)","💧 Cormac returns with water: +4 clean.","Elif heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","👥 Sam sets out to find Maya. \"Won't be long.\"","👥 Cormac walks out with Sam. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","💧 Angelo returns with water: +3 clean.","🥣 Rafael of Ashford walks into your firelight alone, thinner than you remember. \"Our jars are empty,\" they say. No preamble. \"I'm asking for food.\"","🌙 Night. The lingering The Big Beast gorges at the treeline — 1,200 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Paparazzo gorges at the treeline — 800 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 690 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet.","No food in the pantry. The village is hungry. You still get your 1L water.","🩹 You make rounds — Fang gets bound up properly. (68 → 83 HP)","🔍 Shulan crouches over a small thorny tree with wrinkled reddish-brown fruit, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)","Shulan traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Shulan: \"The abiu patch is fruiting again. Somebody should get out there.\"","Shulan and Angelo lingered over the fire together.","🍽️ Elif takes one look at the full shelves and unshoulders the pack. \"Leave the wild standing. Hauling water for the cistern.\"","🍽️ Shulan looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\"","Shulan spent the afternoon sewing, and the Hide armor came apart in their hands. The bark strips are wasted.","🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","— DAY 94 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","📦 Your showbiz fans voted: a wacky curio, gift-wrapped, no note. The note would have explained it. There is no note.","💬 Jesse says: \"My kid asked if the watchers have favorites. I didn't know what to tell her.\"","💬 Maya says: \"They said you're doing well. It sounded... proud? Can they feel proud?\"","Snow by morning. (-8°C — Freezing) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear.","Shulan Huang reads the sky: rain tomorrow, freezing.","The cold works on everyone — the village wakes aching from the deep cold.","Whatever was at the door has moved on — or found easier meat. The call goes quiet.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. Your sleeping body burned less — 26 kcal conserved. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","🌱 Fang waters and weeds the beds before taking up other work. The harvest can wait.","🌿 Fang checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~7 days of fresh on hand… leaves the harvest standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep.","💧 Fang returns with 12L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it.","You catch fragments by the fire — Cormac telling Angelo about Elif. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","💧 Elif returns with water: +2 clean.","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","🚶 Cormac is back with Sam.","Elif heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🚶 Sam is back with Cormac.","Shulan heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","👥 Fang heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\"","👥 Sam walks out with Fang. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 5L left.","Sam left 3 bark strips by the stash. No announcement. That's how it works here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Fang telling Shulan about Elif. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.","Cormac heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\"","Angelo sits by the door re-lacing a strap, testing each pull before the next.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","No watches tonight. Everyone sleeps with one ear open and pretends not to.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Daughter's Drawing. Kitchen table, burnt pancakes. You told her the sun needed holding, and she took you literally — drew you carrying it with both hands. She was six. The sky changed three weeks later. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to creek.","Something pads into the clearing — The Big Beast. It's here.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 3 tiles to meadow.","This patch is worked out — step to another green patch and forage again.","Travel 2 tiles to Haven.","The pantry is bursting past tomorrow — most of the haul stays in your pack. The fire can wait; the road can't.","You keep a day's food (2330 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","You walk back into Haven. 50 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","You catch fragments by the fire — Fang telling Elif about Cormac. The retelling is already better than the event.","💧 Elif returns with water: +3 clean.","💧 Shulan returns with water: +2 clean.","🍲 Shulan is eating by the fire — not talking, just eating.","Village meal: +600 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Fang came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)","🔍 Shulan has been turning over a bushy riverside shrub with small round red-purple fruit, standing in the floodwater half the year for days — today it clicked. \"I know this one now. Look — see the leaves?\"","★ IDENTIFIED: Wild Amaranth. Chaulai (wild amaranth). The weed that feeds — greens now, grain later. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names.","Jesse was watching. Now they know Wild Amaranth too.","Shulan brought you a sample. The Codex grows.","Shulan came back with 581 kcal of something edible. The pantry can't take it all — 291 kcal in, 290 kcal eaten at the fire.","🍽️ Jesse peeks into the pantry, then turns the foraging party back. \"Plenty for days. Teaching the kids snares instead — they'll need to know.\"","🍽️ Cormac taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\"","💧 The cistern's recovered — full cups again, and nobody's guarding the dipper.","🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,330 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate.","— DAY 95 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Wild Amaranth — named and noted.","👀 \"doctor, huh?\" Fang nods — then, an hour later, drops a shop-talk detail no doctor would ever get right. They catch themselves. Too late.","Shulan Huang reads the sky: clear tomorrow, freezing.","Cormac kneels and asks. The land answers: 6 bellies full in Haven today. (Feed the Multitude)","Dawn. You wake rested. (+0 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","🌿 Cormac returns from foraging the wilds: +216 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 216 kcal is eaten at the fire instead.","👥 Elif heads out to forage. \"There's food out there. Going to find it.\"","👥 Angelo walks out with Elif. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","📯 It moves.","Cormac heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Jesse heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","👥 Shulan walks out with Jesse. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","🚶 Sam is back with Fang.","🌿 Fang returns from foraging the wilds: +284 kcal to the pantry — the shelves are full, so 284 kcal is eaten at the fire instead.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":95,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":75,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":91,"opinion":20,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":95,"opinion":19,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_2","name"