egional"},{"day":49,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":50,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":51,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":52,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":53,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":54,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":55,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":56,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":57,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":58,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":59,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":60,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":61,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":62,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":63,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":64,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":65,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":66,"uw":2,"rank":"regional"},{"day":67,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":68,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":69,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":70,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":71,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":72,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":73,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":74,"uw":3,"rank":"regional"},{"day":75,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":76,"uw":4,"rank":"regional"},{"day":77,"uw":4,"rank":"national"},{"day":78,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":79,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":80,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":81,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":82,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":83,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":84,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":85,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":86,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":87,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":88,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":89,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":90,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":91,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":92,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":93,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":94,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":95,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":96,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":97,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":98,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":99,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":100,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":101,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":102,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":103,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":104,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":105,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":106,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":107,"uw":4,"rank":"global"},{"day":108,"uw":4,"rank":"global"}],"transcripts":[{"cls":"herald-refused-first","day":104,"mid":"herald","muster":{"present":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenRaw":0,"havenUnique":0,"need":null,"readyProxy":null},"sayDuring":["⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."],"lines":["You hold still, watching.","💥 heckler's attack finds you — no dodging it.","Armor absorbs 8.","Heckler's attack hits you for 3.","📖 Codex: Compulsion — strikes one target after a windup. You won't forget this.","\"The crowd goes mild!\" (SHAME 1)","Your strikes land harder. (x1.15 training)","FEASTED ×2.03: the feast was the weapon.","The Heckler falls.","You STRIKE the heckler for 91 (Shard spear).","📺 +5 style — solid hit","📺 +20 style — dropped the Heckler!","It is all mouth. You are not hungry enough.","You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.","💛 You hold Unnamed photograph. There is a name you won't say out loud anymore. The photo doesn't need you to say it. Somebody you loved didn't make it to the clearing, and this is what's left of the proof they were here. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — the haven's talking about nothing else.","Back at the haven the argument starts: Esther is calling it \"Big Loud.\" Nobody agrees yet — weigh in if you want.","You work the patch with practiced hands: 20× White Oak Acorns (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (1710 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","You walk back into Haven. 42 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","You sow Muscadine Grapes: 365 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","You coax 3 growing beds forward by 14 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","Taken: Stripped hide x1, Stripped hide x1, Death Mask x1.","The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking.","Taken: Gland sac x1, Teeth x4.","The body is stripped. What's left isn't worth taking.","✨ Ability gained: Adrenaline Surge (L1). Adrenaline hits and the world slows — you are harder to hit when it matters.","\"Earned, not given. You did the work — we just wrote it down.\"","Dawn's an hour off — too late for real sleep. Rest a while instead, or wait for morning.","💧 Nikolai returns with water: +2 clean.","🧳 A traveler swears Thornfield, southeast, is feasting — a whole elk, they say. (They're wrong. Thornfield is starving.)","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,050 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering Static gorges at the treeline — 1,440 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","★ IDENTIFIED: Elderberry. White flower clusters in spring, dark berries in late summer. Uses unknown — harvest, taste, and learn.","SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost.","📚 Village knowledge: Adaeze taught everyone about Elderberry. The Codex grows without you lifting a finger.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach.","Village meal: +2330 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Esther and Phinit are comparing scars like trading cards.","Esther has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. Fireside lesson: Adaeze passes around Elderberry. Someone asks a dumb question. Nobody minds. That's how you learn.","🔍 Adaeze crouches over a clustering palm with orange date-like fruits, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)","Adaeze traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Farid and Frank lingered over the fire together.","Nikolai and Sam lingered over the fire together.","🤒 Frank is back on their feet — the fever ran its course.","Stonebridge's speaker sent a runner: the northwest ground feeds both villages or neither. They want to talk — properly, at their fire. Ignoring this is also an answer.","Thornfield's speaker sent a runner: the southeast ground feeds both villages or neither. They want to talk — properly, at their fire. Ignoring this is also an answer.","— DAY 103 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","The fire burns low. One new line in the journal: Elderberry — named and noted.","📦 A care package drops from the sky with a little parachute. There's a note: \"WE LOVE YOU! — your showbiz fans\"","Inside: Audience token","Plus 57 kcal of fan-approved snacks.","📦 Your showbiz fans voted: a wacky curio, gift-wrapped, no note. The note would have explained it. There is no note.","💬 Taner says: \"Someone's been leaving food out. Good food. Don't ask me how I know it wasn't one of us.\"","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","📯 It moves.","👥 Esther heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Frank walks out with Esther. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Sam heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\"","👥 Farid heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","👥 Nikolai walks out with Farid. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","👥 Nora heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\"","👥 Benoit walks out with Nora. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Phinit heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","Its posture changes. Curiosity is over.","You catch fragments by the fire — Benoit telling Esther about herself. The story's getting bigger than what happened.","You catch fragments by the fire — Frank telling Farid about Nikolai. Someone's added a flourish that wasn't there this morning.","You catch fragments by the fire — Sam telling Adaeze about Nikolai. The details have shifted. Nobody seems to mind.","Word gets around the haven. Whatever that thing was — every fire has a theory tonight.","Back at the haven the argument starts: Esther is calling it \"The Loud Beast.\" The name's up for grabs — weigh in if you want.","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","💛 You hold Unnamed photograph. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)","💛 You hold Seed packet. Pressed into your hand with an order: keep people fed through winter. Seeds are a plan. Plans are how you stop being helpless. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)","Travel 1 tile to grove.","It followed you. The Herald is here.","You catch fragments by the fire — Esther telling Nora about herself. It's barely the same story now. That's what fires do.","A sturdy stick (crafting material).","You work the patch with practiced hands: 12× White Oak Acorns (in shell — shell them to eat). This patch is picked clean — it'll recover in a few days.","Travel 1 tile to Haven.","The Herald stops at the boundary — pacing, unwilling. Something else is already here. It's still out there.","You keep a day's food (1530 kcal) — nothing extra for the pantry this time.","1 unprocessed haul onto the counter — the clock is ticking.","You walk back into Haven. 43 Codex entries. The village is glad to see you.","You clear a dead bed. Sow fresh seed to start a new crop. (40 kcal.)","The static resolves into something almost like a voice. Almost like yours.","You sow Muscadine Grapes: 365 days to first harvest. Later harvests need 45 days of regrowth. Tend daily; garden magic can accelerate growth. (2 units sown.)","📻 It moves.","You coax 4 growing beds forward by 14 days. The next harvest carries the growth magic.","(−200 kcal — food becomes green thumb.)","You settle into the hall floor. Sleep takes you.","💧 Phinit returns with water: +3 clean.","— NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.","Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.","🌿 Sam returns from foraging the wilds: +549 kcal to the pantry.","🚶 Benoit is back with Nora.","💧 Nora returns with water: +2 clean.","🧳 A traveler from northwest says Stonebridge is starving — Sanne's been seen counting empty jars, and the kids have gone quiet.","Omar waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","🌙 Night. The lingering The Herald gorges at the treeline — 1,400 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","🌙 Night. The lingering Static gorges at the treeline — 1,200 kcal gone from the stores. Endure it (they drift off within ~6 nights — the gorge is the price), or send a sortie: fighters, rations, real risk.","A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet.","⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started.","Village meal: +2349 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry.","Adaeze traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Phinit and Nora lingered over the fire together.","🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)","🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)","— DAY 104 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","Snow by morning. (-8°C — Freezing) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear.","The cold works on everyone — the village wakes aching from the deep cold.","Dawn. You wake rested. (+27 health, energy restored. By the fire. Good enough.)","No risky water to boil.","Drank clean water.","The feast's fire burns low — the buff fades with the night. (Feasted expired.)","💧 Esther returns with water: +4 clean.","🚶 Frank is back with Esther.","Sam heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\"","💧 Farid returns with water: +4 clean.","🚶 Nikolai is back with Farid.","👥 Benoit sets out to find Esther. \"Won't be long.\"","👥 Esther walks out with Benoit. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved.","— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","Filled 1L (clean — Haven well). 3L carried (3kg). (-10 kcal hauling, 1 tick.) Cistern: 7L left.","📯 It moves.","👥 Frank heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Farid walks out with Frank. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","👥 Nikolai heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\"","👥 Nora walks out with Nikolai. \"Nobody walks alone today.\"","Phinit heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\"","— DUSK — Animals stir again. Shadows lengthen.","You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you.","📯 It moves.","⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."]}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":104,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":94,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":65,"opinion":22,"arrears":26000,"quota":2,"facesFree":5,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":true,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":94,"opinion":44,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":3,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":3},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":49,"opinion":26,"arrears":11000,"quota":2,"facesFree":4,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":true,"wouldYield":0}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":3,"callOffered":true,"commitOffered":true,"volunteers":0,"outcomesPrior":0,"callsSoFar":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0}},{"idx":1,"day":104,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":94,"lin